{"v":1,"id":"909ab4353b8b","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"The sound is rising, not all will listen, not all will turn.","s":11.7,"e":20.1},{"t":"There's a fire in the word","s":25.42,"e":28.3},{"t":"When it's spoken","s":28.3,"e":30.18},{"t":"Not soft, not safely ignored","s":32.0,"e":36.04},{"t":"It cuts through stone","s":37.68,"e":39.92},{"t":"It splits the heart","s":40.64,"e":43.04},{"t":"Like a sharpened two-edged sword","s":44.78,"e":49.68},{"t":"Some hear hope in the sound of truth","s":50.86,"e":56.2},{"t":"But earth, feel the burn","s":58.44,"e":62.54},{"t":"The same flame that lights the path","s":64.96,"e":67.96},{"t":"Is the fire","s":70.5,"e":72.3},{"t":"That makes men turn","s":72.3,"e":75.56},{"t":"You can't stand still","s":75.56,"e":78.8},{"t":"When the trumpet cries","s":79.3,"e":81.68},{"t":"You either bow","s":83.14,"e":85.02},{"t":"Or you fight","s":86.52,"e":88.42},{"t":"Every soul","s":90.22,"e":91.9},{"t":"Will answer once","s":92.78,"e":95.04},{"t":"When the dark collides with light","s":96.58,"e":101.98},{"t":"Hear the call, it's ringing now","s":102.5,"e":107.88},{"t":"Hear the warning in the sound","s":109.52,"e":114.48},{"t":"A shout, a witness, truth proclaimed","s":114.48,"e":120.74},{"t":"No middle ground","s":121.84,"e":123.98},{"t":"No neutral ground","s":124.5,"e":127.4},{"t":"Heed the call","s":129.12,"e":130.68},{"t":"Repent","s":131.24,"e":132.4},{"t":"Return","s":132.4,"e":133.7},{"t":"Before the final fire burns","s":133.7,"e":136.96},{"t":"Mercy calls you while it may","s":137.5,"e":140.2},{"t":"Tomorrow's not a promised day","s":140.82,"e":143.36},{"t":"Words like fire","s":148.0,"e":150.2},{"t":"Fire upon the proud","s":150.2,"e":153.38},{"t":"Foreheads marked with flame","s":156.12,"e":159.9},{"t":"Tears will fall where hearts are pierced","s":160.42,"e":166.7},{"t":"When truth exposes names","s":166.7,"e":172.54},{"t":"Some are struck and rise again","s":174.0,"e":179.2},{"t":"Washed, forgiven, clean","s":183.1,"e":185.48},{"t":"Others clench their fists in rage","s":188.78,"e":192.42},{"t":"And curse what they have seen","s":194.26,"e":198.68},{"t":"The blade is sharp","s":199.9,"e":202.04},{"t":"The hour is near","s":203.12,"e":205.22},{"t":"The line is clearly drawn","s":206.78,"e":211.72},{"t":"Every lie will lose its grip","s":213.02,"e":218.34},{"t":"When the trumpet carries on","s":219.68,"e":224.8},{"t":"Heed the call, it's ringing now","s":226.24,"e":231.12},{"t":"Hear the warning in the sound","s":232.4,"e":237.76},{"t":"A shout, a witness","s":237.76,"e":241.1},{"t":"Truth proclaimed","s":241.1,"e":244.02},{"t":"No middle ground","s":244.64,"e":247.18},{"t":"No neutral ground","s":247.72,"e":250.64},{"t":"Heed the call","s":252.22,"e":253.92},{"t":"Repent","s":254.48,"e":255.54},{"t":"Return","s":255.54,"e":256.96},{"t":"Before the final fire burns","s":257.64,"e":260.18},{"t":"Mercy calls you while it may","s":260.18,"e":263.42},{"t":"Tomorrow's not a promised day","s":264.08,"e":266.62},{"t":"This is not a whisper","s":276.7,"e":279.88},{"t":"This is not a tale","s":279.88,"e":282.9},{"t":"This is judgment mixed with grace","s":283.88,"e":287.1},{"t":"A choice that will not fail","s":287.1,"e":289.56},{"t":"The word goes out","s":289.56,"e":292.88},{"t":"It will not fall","s":292.88,"e":296.06},{"t":"Empty to the ground","s":298.58,"e":300.8},{"t":"It saves or it convents","s":300.8,"e":304.3},{"t":"Depending","s":304.3,"e":305.62},{"t":"How it's found","s":307.16,"e":309.22},{"t":"Heed the call","s":310.78,"e":312.34},{"t":"The trumpet cries","s":313.06,"e":315.42},{"t":"Wake, arise, open your eyes","s":316.78,"e":322.18},{"t":"Truth has come, the door is near","s":322.72,"e":328.5},{"t":"Love still calls, but so does fear","s":328.5,"e":335.0},{"t":"Heed the call, choose life today","s":336.6,"e":341.28},{"t":"day turn your heart don't walk away the fire speaks the word is true","s":341.28,"e":354.4},{"t":"the call it sounded what will you do therefore hear the word of the lord and heed the call","s":355.66,"e":367.1},{"t":"for it is a call to repentance a shout and a witness","s":369.28,"e":374.56},{"t":"a proclamation of truth","s":376.12,"e":380.06},{"t":"a trumpet of alarm and war a declaration","s":383.24,"e":388.42},{"t":"of judgment a strong rebuke","s":389.86,"e":395.22},{"t":"Says the Lord.","s":398.24,"e":399.58},{"t":"Says the Lord.","s":421.22,"e":422.68},{"t":"We'll be right back.","s":435.44,"e":436.6},{"t":"We'll see you next time.","s":468.68,"e":468.76}],"match":null}
